<title>UK: CRICKET-ENGLISH SUNDAY LEAGUE RESULTS.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-ENGLISH SUNDAY LEAGUE RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of English Sunday League</p>
<p>(40 overs) cricket matches:</p>
<p>At Chelmsford: Essex beat Hampshire by three wickets.</p>
<p>Hampshire 198-5 innings closed (W.Kendall 55, M Keech 52) v</p>
<p>Essex 202-7 in 39.5 overs.</p>
<p>At Cardiff: Glamorgan beat Warwickshire on faster scoring</p>
<p>rate. Warwickshire 147-7 innings closed (S.Watkin 4-15) v</p>
<p>Glamorgan 81-3 in 20 overs.</p>
<p>At Canterbury: Kent beat Derbyshire by six wickets.</p>
<p>Derbyshire 184-8 innings closed (G.Khan 71 not out). Kent 185-4</p>
<p>in 31.3 overs (M.Walker 80, A.Wells 56 not out).</p>
<p>At Old Trafford: Lancashire beat Durham by 57 runs.</p>
<p>Lancashire 268-6 Innings closed (G.Lloyd 134, J.Crawley 83).</p>
<p>Durham 211-5 innings closed (M.Roseberry 91 not out).</p>
<p>At Leicester: Gloucestershire beat Leicestershire by 111</p>
<p>runs.</p>
<p>Gloucestershire 236-8 innings closed. Leicestershire 125-9</p>
<p>innings closed.</p>
<p>At Trent Bridge: Worcestershire beat Nottinghamshire by</p>
<p>seven wickets. Nottinghamshire 183-8 innings closed.</p>
<p>Worcestershire 184-3 in 38.4 overs (T.Moody 89).</p>
<p>At The Oval: Surrey beat Somerset by three wickets. Somerset</p>
<p>180 in 37.4 overs (R.Harden 53). Surrey 181-7 in 39.5 overs</p>
<p>(C.Lewis 68 not out).</p>
<p>At Hove: Northamptonshire beat Sussex by nine wickets.</p>
<p>Sussex 160 in 35.2 overs (K.Greenfield 58; J. Snape 4-31).</p>
<p>Northamptonshire 162-1 in 30.3 overs (A.Penberthy 74 not out,</p>
<p>M.Loye 68).</p>
</text>
